      | 2    | dias   | 3 horas | 2026-07-15T10:00:00 | 2026-07-15T11:00:00 | 2026-07-15T11:30:00 | 0.5      |

  # Postponed task status 18
  # With now earlier than desde (out-of-sync clocks), the task stays
